scriptunit-fragment 1
----------

var a = [1]

----------
scriptunit-fragment 2
----------

let b = a

----------
scriptunit-fragment 3
----------

var d = 5

----------
scriptunit-fragment 4
----------

let q = 100 /! d

----------
scriptunit-fragment 5
----------

let e = q + 1
set a = [2]

----------
scriptunit-fragment 6
----------

let c = a

----------
expect all six units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `a` taken |
| 2 | takes `a` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `b` = [1] |
| 3 | - | compiles, runs | new | `d` = 5 |
| 4 | reads `d` (3) | compiles, runs | new | `q` = 20 |
| 5 | reads `q` (4), revives `a` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `e` = 21 |
| 6 | takes `a` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = [2] |

