scriptunit-edit 3
----------

var d = 0

----------
expect unit 3 is edited so unit 4 returns early
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 5 revived `a` when it last ran, and is blocked now | `a` taken |
| 2 | takes `a` (1) | reruns | it took `a`, which unit 1 builds again | `b` = [1] |
| 3 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `d` = 0 |
| 4 | reads `d` (3) | reruns, returns early | `100 /! 0` | - |
| 5 | reads `q` (4), revives `a` (1) | is blocked | unit 4 did not finish | - |
| 6 | takes `a` (1) | is blocked | unit 5 did not finish | - |

